<title>RUSSIA: Russia Pallada GKO fund assets 6 mln rbls on Nov 2.</title>
<headline>Russia Pallada GKO fund assets 6 mln rbls on Nov 2.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pallada Government Securities Unit Investment Fund, which started operating on Tuesday, said on Wednesday its net assets amounted to six million roubles.</p>
<p>A unit in the fund is 10,000 roubles each, a fund spokesman said.</p>
<p>The fund has already sold 600 units, he said.</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
